[1.746434, "o", "Path (3 steps): MaximumIndependentSet/SimpleGraph/One → MaximumSetPacking/One → ILP/bool\r\n\r\n  Step 1: MaximumIndependentSet/SimpleGraph/One → MaximumSetPacking/One\r\n    num_sets = O(num_vertices)\r\n    universe_size = O(num_edges)\r\n\r\n  Step 2: MaximumSetPacking/One → MaximumSetPacking/i32\r\n    num_sets = O(num_sets)\r\n    universe_size = O(universe_size)\r\n\r\n  Step 3: MaximumSetPacking/i32 → ILP/bool\r\n    num_vars = O(num_sets)\r\n    num_constraints = O(universe_size)\r\n\r\n  Overall:\r\n    num_vars = O(num_vertices)\r\n    num_constraints = O(num_edges)\r\n\r\n"]
